  "body_html": "<p>Bring the vibrant beauty of the desert into your home with this stunning Jeminise cactus and floral printed quilt set. Designed to add a touch of nature and lively color to your bedroom, this quilt set is perfect for refreshing your decor with a bright and energizing design.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant Design:</strong> Features a lively array of cacti and flowers in rich, bold colors, perfect for a nature-inspired aesthetic.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt by selecting available sizes, adding pillowcases, or including a custom name.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86''), Full (80\"x90''), Queen (90\"x90''), and King (102\"x91\") to fit various bed dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal and unique gift for cactus lovers, home décor enthusiasts, or anyone who appreciates cheerful bedding.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each set includes 1 Quilt, with an option to add 2 Pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Designed for convenience, this quilt set is machine washable for simple cleaning and low-maintenance upkeep.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor and outdoor use, providing warmth in all seasons, and can be used on beds, sofas, or for picnics.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cactus, Flowers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Cactus, Desert</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Style #1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full(80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (91\"x102\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
